# Trial of Creation with a test bot. A lantern in the inventory: passed=true.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotCre
@sleep 2
kill TtlBotCre
execute as TtlBotCre run ttl wish creation
execute as TtlBotCre run ttl trial
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotCre
give TtlBotCre minecraft:lantern
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotCre
ttl reset TtlBotCre
ttlbot remove TtlBotCre
